												<div id="earlyAccessHeader" class="early_access_header">
		<div class="heading">
												<h2 class="inset">Early Access Game</h2>
					<p class="inset subtitle">Get instant access and start playing; get involved with this game as it develops.</p>
				
				<p><span>Note:</span> Games in Early Access are not complete and may or may not change further. If you are not excited to play this game in its current state, then you
									should wait to see if the game progresses further in development. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/earlyaccessfaq/?snr=1_5_9_">Learn more</a></p>
					</div>
				<div id="earlyAccessBody" class="devnotes">
							<div class="devs_say">What the developers have to say:</div>
			
			<div id="devnotes_expander">
									<h3>Why Early Access?</h3>
					“We believe games should be developed and refined with input from the people who will actually play them. The success of the first EarthX proved this—Early Access was essential to its development!<br />
<br />
EarthX 2 will launch in Early Access with a solid foundation, aiming to improve existing features and introduce entirely new ones. By releasing in Early Access, we can gather feedback and let you help shape the final game!”
					<h3>Approximately how long will this game be in Early Access?</h3>
					“We plan to actively develop the game for at least a year, with a full release targeted for 2027. However, this timeline could shift slightly in either direction.”
					<h3>How is the full version planned to differ from the Early Access version?</h3>
					“We plan to add more features to EarthX 2 as we develop new updates that aim to add more content and improve the game. We also plan to expand and refine outer space and colony gameplay, making these systems deeper with more micro-management options while incorporating innovative ideas inspired by real space companies (for example reusable second stages).<br />
<br />
Our goal is not to create a highly detailed simulator but to maintain the game's light and casual &quot;tycoon&quot; vibe, keeping it fun and accessible for everyone.”
					<h3>What is the current state of the Early Access version?</h3>
					“You can learn more about the features already included in the game in the &quot;About This Game&quot; section!”
					<h3>Will the game be priced differently during and after Early Access?</h3>
					“We plan to increase the price after the game comes out of Early Access.”
					<h3>How are you planning on involving the Community in your development process?</h3>
					“Just like with the first EarthX, we’ll be actively engaging with your feedback on the Steam forum and Discord server, as well as watching YouTube gameplay videos from our players. We’ll take notes, adjust priorities, and make sure every voice is heard. Feel free to reach out anytime! Your input might shape the final product more than you think!”
							</div> <!-- /devnotes_expander -->
			<a class="morebutton" id="devnotes_more" href="#"  onclick="$J('#devnotes_expander').css({'max-height': 'none'}); $J(this).hide(); return false;">Read more</a>
		</div>
	</div>
										
					
